      "summary": ": Today at Treble Cone 27 Aug 2026 – \"Treble Cone will be CLOSED today The storm is still on us having brought rain, wind, snow, more rain, more snow and everything in between. And it is not done yet with another strong pulse coming through today and the freezing level going up, down and around and around. All in all it is making it impossible to safely operate today which is always gutting. Rest up TC crew, there is still more snow to come and fun turns await in the future. Wānaka primary skiing is postponed TC Snowboard Banked Slalom pre-qualifiers have been cancelled for tomorrow however all racers will advance to the main event on Saturday. Sunday is a weather day.\"",
